WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:06.500
Yes, indeed.

2
00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:11.340
It is called Lothric,

3
00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:18.920
where the transitory lands
of the Lords of Cinder converge.

4
00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:26.280
In venturing north,

5
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:33.940
the pilgrims discover
the truth of the old words:

6
00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:40.200
"The fire fades,

7
00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:45.140
and the lords go without thrones."

8
00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:04.760
When the link of the fire is threatened,

9
00:01:05.900 --> 00:01:08.140
the bell tolls,

10
00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:14.270
unearthing the old Lords of Cinder
from their graves.

11
00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:25.960
Aldrich, Saint of the Deep.

12
00:01:38.140 --> 00:01:40.560
Farron's Undead Legion,

13
00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:43.140
the Abyss Watchers.

14
00:01:55.070 --> 00:01:59.140
And the reclusive lord
of the Profaned Capital,

15
00:02:04.860 --> 00:02:07.800
Yhorm the Giant.

16
00:02:24.900 --> 00:02:27.840
Only, in truth,

17
00:02:29.880 --> 00:02:33.020
the lords will abandon their thrones.

18
00:02:40.440 --> 00:02:46.080
And the Unkindled will rise.

19
00:02:53.660 --> 00:02:59.560
Nameless, accursed Undead,
unfit even to be cinder.

20
00:02:59.560 --> 00:03:03.900
And so it is,

21
00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:08.820
that ash seeketh embers.
